# activities-only-standalone — a shared disposition library used with NO decision library
library "Dispositions".

// The emit entry IS this activities-only library — the closure has NO graph-root
// decision library to rebind onto, so it is NOT suppressed (unchanged pre-#186
// behavior): it keeps its own CQL + FHIR Library, self-bound. No rebind is recorded.

activity "Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.
